Glauber dynamics new spin state probability:

$
  PP[S_i^(t+dif t) = s] = exp(-(1/T) dot s dot [h_i + sum_(j eq.not i) J_(i,j) dot s_j^t])/(exp(-(1/T) dot (+1) dot [h_i + sum_(j eq.not i) J_(i,j) dot s_j^t]) + exp(-(1/T) dot (-1) dot [h_i + sum_(j eq.not i) J_(i,j) dot s_j^t]))
$

Equivalent form in terms of logistic function:
$
  PP[S_i^(t+dif t) = s] = op("logistic")(-2 s dot (1/T) dot [h_i + sum_(j eq.not i) J_(i,j) dot s_j^t])
$

